{"id":"df8eac4626d45afe","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-partial-martingale.md","title":"部分实值可计算性与部分鞅","display":"df-partial-martingale — 部分实值可计算性与部分鞅","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-partial-martingale","aliases":["43-df-partial-martingale"],"display":"df-partial-martingale — 部分实值可计算性与部分鞅","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"§12.2, paragraph preceding Theorem 12.2.1","source_printed_pages":"327–328","source_pdf_pages":"347–348","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-partial-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-partial-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-martingale — 部分实值可计算性与部分鞅"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12.2, paragraph preceding Theorem 12.2.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"327–328"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"347–348"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 为携带 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a> 中指定编码的域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:E\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R\">\\(d:E\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(m:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)\">\\(D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)\\)</span>。部分可计算性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>，串连接采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}\">\\(\\operatorname{graph}\\)</span> 表示部分函数图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_E(d)\\iff\\exists q:E\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(q)=\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\times\\mathbb N\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(((x,k),r)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(q)\\land|r-d(x)|\\le2^{-k})\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_E(d)\\iff\\exists q:E\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(q)=\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\times\\mathbb N\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(((x,k),r)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(q)\\land|r-d(x)|\\le2^{-k})\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\iff(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall i&lt;2\\;(\\sigma i\\in D\\Rightarrow\\sigma\\in D))\\land(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\sigma0\\in D\\iff\\sigma1\\in D))\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau0\\in D\\land\\tau1\\in D\\}\\;2m(\\sigma)=m(\\sigma0)+m(\\sigma1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\iff(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall i&lt;2\\;(\\sigma i\\in D\\Rightarrow\\sigma\\in D))\\land(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\sigma0\\in D\\iff\\sigma1\\in D))\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau0\\in D\\land\\tau1\\in D\\}\\;2m(\\sigma)=m(\\sigma0)+m(\\sigma1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有函数值都在其域内取用。域前缀闭且兄弟同时定义，排除仅定义赢侧的退化下注；空域允许但不能成功。近似机器的实际停机域恰为dom(d)×N，确保部分实值计算的域与精度参数一致。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§12.2, paragraph preceding Theorem 12.2.1。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E$ 为携带 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 中指定编码的域，$d:E\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R$；$m:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$、$D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)$。部分可计算性采用 [[43-df-computable]]，串连接采用 [[43-df-string]]。$\\operatorname{graph}$ 表示部分函数图。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E$ 为携带 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 中指定编码的域，$d:E\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R$；$m:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$、$D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)$。部分可计算性采用 [[43-df-computable]]，串连接采用 [[43-df-string]]。$\\operatorname{graph}$ 表示部分函数图。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E$ 为携带 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 中指定编码的域，$d:E\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R$；$m:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$、$D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)$。部分可计算性采用 [[43-df-computable]]，串连接采用 [[43-df-string]]。$\\operatorname{graph}$ 表示部分函数图。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"d:E\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"m:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_E(d)\\iff\\exists q:E\\times\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(q)=\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\times\\mathbb N\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(((x,k),r)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(q)\\land|r-d(x)|\\le2^{-k})\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\iff(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall i<2\\;(\\sigma i\\in D\\Rightarrow\\sigma\\in D))\\land(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;(\\sigma0\\in D\\iff\\sigma1\\in D))\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau0\\in D\\land\\tau1\\in D\\}\\;2m(\\sigma)=m(\\sigma0)+m(\\sigma1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{<\\omega}}(m).","display":true}],"bytes":2327,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9a802fc6a847063","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal A$ 为下式定义的有限赋值序列域；$w^\\frown(r,b)$ 表示向序列追加一个位置—比特对，$\\operatorname{pos}(w)$ 由下式定义。$s:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$、$q:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup[0,2]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。有限赋值序列使用 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 的产品及有限序列编码；$\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-partial-martingale]]。$P_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathcal A$、$D_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 为下式递归确定的空集或单点集。"},{"id":"a0abc398f6f3118e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in